---
title: dinyd · preserve locked source before an edit
config:
  look: classic
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    actorBkg: "#333333"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#fcd34d"
    labelTextColor: "#000000"
    noteTextColor: "#e0e0e0"
  themeCSS: |
    /* database · db */
    g.actor[transform] path { fill: #1c2f4a; stroke: #93c5fd; }
    /* database label clears the cylinder */
    g.actor[transform] + text { transform: translateY(12px); }
    g.actor[transform] + text tspan { paint-order: stroke; stroke: #1f1f1f; stroke-width: 6px; }
    /* collections · file */
    rect.actor:not([rx]) { fill: #3d3415; stroke: #fcd34d; }
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 80
    width: 200
    wrap: true
---
%% Behavior authority: lock.md.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Agent as agent
  participant Host as agent host
  participant Guard as selected dinyd
  participant Doc@{ "type": "collections", "alias": "working-tree document" }

  Agent->>Host: propose a file edit
  Host->>Guard: before execution · raw arguments and project context
  Guard->>Doc: read current bytes and lock markers

  rect rgb(23, 61, 37)
    Note over Guard,Doc: em · preserve the source and its protection
    Guard->>Guard: preview changed files and re-parse locks
  end

  alt protected source survives
    Guard-->>Host: allow
    Host->>Doc: execute the original edit tool
  else protected source changes or cannot be verified
    Guard-->>Host: native denial
    Host-->>Agent: path and short instruction · no document content
  end
